## Implemented
- **Arcane Signet** — immediate `{T}` mana, colors from the registered commander’s explicit color identity (W/U/B/R/G order). No commander or empty identity offers no colors.
- **Fellwar Stone** — immediate mana from opponent-controlled lands’ typed production, including tapped lands; excludes own lands, artifacts, colorless, eliminated opponents; colors update when lands leave.
- **Werebear** — `{1}{G}` 1/1; real green tap mana ability with summoning-sickness refusal; Threshold layer 7c +3/+3 at ≥7 cards in controller’s graveyard, both directions, excluding opponents’ graveyards, stacking with typed counters/pumps.

Dynamic colors use new explicit `ActivateColorManaAbility` legal actions. Forged colors are refused before tap/mutation with unchanged state; activation is immediate (no stack/priority transfer). Existing fixed Sol Ring/Mind Stone/Hedron behavior unchanged.

